//github.com/SaranSundar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SaranSundar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SaranSundar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SaranSundar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SaranSundar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SaranSundar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SaranSundar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SaranSundar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SaranSundar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/SaranSundar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-16T20:25:15Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T20:25:15Z","body":"How do I sign it myself? Or rather if I re-download now is the issue fixed for 4.7-dev-1?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3910390539/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3910460891","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116054#issuecomment-3910460891","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116054","id":3910460891,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pFOXb","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-16T20:50:47Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T20:50:47Z","body":"> Or rather if I re-download now is the issue fixed for 4.7-dev-1?\n\nIt's not fixed for `dev-1`, but will be for next build. `4.6.1-stable` is also fixed.\n\n> How do I sign it myself?\n\nUsing the following command `codesign -s {YOUR_DEV_ID} --deep --force --options=runtime --entitlements {PATH_TO}/editor.entitlements {PATH_TO}/Godot.app`\n\nYou'll need `editor.entitlements` from here - https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/misc/dist/macos/editor.entitlements\n\n`{YOUR_DEV_ID}` can be `-` for ad-hoc signature or your Apple dev account name.\n\nBut it will still re-ask for permissions every time you switch between it and signed official builds, so you might want to skip `dev-1` and wait for `dev-2` instead.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3910460891/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3910863931","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116054#issuecomment-3910863931","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116054","id":3910863931,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pGww7","user":{"login":"angstsmurf","id":5066755,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNjY3NTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5066755?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/angstsmurf","html_url":"https://github.com/angstsmurf","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angstsmurf/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angstsmurf/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angstsmurf/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angstsmurf/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angstsmurf/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angstsmurf/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angstsmurf/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angstsmurf/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/angstsmurf/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-16T23:03:05Z","updated_at":"2026-02-16T23:04:12Z","body":"> This is expected from `4.6.1-rc1` and `4.7-dev1` since both were unsigned due to temporary issues with signing\n\nI use several unsigned apps on my Mac, but Godot is the only one that that asks for permission on _every_ file access. Most apps seem to ask once for each folder, and then retain the permission until they are closed. Godot must be doing something unusual.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3910863931/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3914561922","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/116054#issuecomment-3914561922","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116054","id":3914561922,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7pU3mC","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/user